usage: xuanpu-finance-maintenance [-h] --database-dsn-file DATABASE_DSN_FILE
                                  --objects OBJECTS --key-file KEY_FILE
                                  [--package PACKAGE] [--pg-tool PG_TOOL]
                                  {backup,restore,verify}

独立财务数据库与加密原件配套维护

positional arguments:
  {backup,restore,verify}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --database-dsn-file DATABASE_DSN_FILE
  --objects OBJECTS     独立local密文根；恢复时必须不存在
  --key-file KEY_FILE   另行保全的32字节密钥，密钥不会写入备份
  --package PACKAGE     备份目标或恢复来源目录
  --pg-tool PG_TOOL     明确指定成熟pg_dump或pg_restore程序路径
